----------------------------------------------------------------------
 Custom Scan (LagoDB Query Offload)
   Engine: DataFusion
   ->  Sort
         Sort Key: group_id ASC NULLS LAST
         ->  Filter
               Filter: ((SUM(value) > runtime value::decimal(38, 0)))
               ->  Aggregate
                     Group Key: group_id
                     Aggregates: SUM(value)
                     ->  Table Scan on query_offload_int8_sum
                           Access Method: iceberg
(11 rows)

